# Trained PBMC model of the paper. Tracks only the configs, metrics, causal graph and summary figures (PDF); everything
# else (checkpoints, TensorBoard, per-step images, datasets, simulated cells, inferred GRNs, GPU traces, logs) stays local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.cfg
.config.*.cfg
!*.json
!data/processed/*/causal_graph.pkl
!data/processed/*/TFs.csv
!data/processed/*/convert.py
!results/inset-scatterfig*/*.pdf
!results/infer_grn_*/generated/*.pdf
